WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.533
Five rectangles, fixed sizes, no rotation.

2
00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:12.556
Fixed outline 10 × 8; origin lower-left, y up.

3
00:00:12.556 --> 00:00:17.156
Given pos and neg, find every block's coordinates.

4
00:00:17.556 --> 00:00:22.356
For each pair, compare its order in the two permutations.

5
00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:25.956
First in both: on the left.

6
00:00:25.956 --> 00:00:30.311
First in pos, second in neg: below.

7
00:00:30.311 --> 00:00:35.778
If a book says 'above', swap the two sequences.

8
00:00:36.178 --> 00:00:41.378
Ten pairs, each relation written down.

9
00:00:41.378 --> 00:00:45.378
Left/right goes into H, below/above into V.

10
00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:49.978
Each pair goes into one graph: six in H, four in V.

11
00:00:50.378 --> 00:00:55.978
In pos order, compute x block by block.

12
00:00:55.978 --> 00:01:00.978
E's predecessors A, B, C: candidates 3, 5, 7.

13
00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:06.000
Add the predecessor's width; the maximum, x[E] = 7.

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.400
D has no horizontal predecessor: x[D] = 0.

15
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.400
Now y: D's vertical predecessors are the other four.

16
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.978
The tallest is B: y[D] = 0 + 3 = 3.

17
00:01:19.978 --> 00:01:23.578
The other four stay at y = 0.

18
00:01:23.978 --> 00:01:28.978
Then answer four separate questions.

19
00:01:28.978 --> 00:01:32.889
Box 9 × 4, inside 10 × 8.

20
00:01:32.889 --> 00:01:37.489
Outline unused and density are constants.

21
00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:42.689
Identical permutations: one row, 12 wide.

22
00:01:42.689 --> 00:01:47.044
Reverse neg: one column, 10 tall.

23
00:01:47.044 --> 00:01:51.444
Both valid and overlap-free, neither fits.

24
00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:55.978
Same order is left/right; opposite is below/above.

25
00:01:55.978 --> 00:01:59.667
One edge per pair, all along pos.

26
00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:04.467
A coordinate is a longest path: add the size, take the max.

27
00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:09.467
No overlap is guaranteed; fit is checked separately.
